# Strata minimal desktop.
#
# Every package here traces to ADR-0009 or ADR-0010. Adding anything means
# arguing against ADR-0003 first.

# Compositor and shell
hyprland
quickshell

# Hyprland's dialog helpers: hyprland-dialog, hyprland-welcome and friends.
# Hyprland uses them to put errors on screen, and warns at startup when they are
# missing. Roughly 2.5 MB with libhyprtoolkit5, and hyprland does not even
# Recommend it, so it has to be listed here.
#
# This is a deliberate exception to ADR-0003's minimalism: a system that silently
# swallows its own error messages is not minimal, it is undiagnosable. Two
# separate investigations in this project were prolonged by exactly that —
# Calamares dying with no dialog, and a greeter failing with no visible cause.
hyprland-guiutils

# ADR-0010: the Qt6 Wayland platform plugin (platforms/libqwayland.so) lives in
# this package. quickshell already depends on it, but Calamares relies on it too
# and would fall back to libqxcb.so with no error if that dependency ever
# changed. Pinned explicitly so the installer's Wayland path cannot break
# silently.
libqt6waylandclient6

# ADR-0010: arrives via hyprland's Recommends, listed explicitly so it does not
# depend on recommends handling staying as it is.
xwayland

# Portals. xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland does not implement FileChooser, so the
# GTK backend is required for file dialogs.
xdg-desktop-portal
xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland
xdg-desktop-portal-gtk

# Terminal and launcher. foot renders on the CPU with no EGL dependency, which
# keeps it working in the QEMU environment CI validates images in. fuzzel shares
# foot's rendering stack, so it costs almost nothing on top.
foot
fuzzel

# Notifications. NOT the package named `mako` — that source package builds
# python3-mako, a Python template library.
mako-notifier

# Clipboard. cliphist exists because on Wayland the clipboard dies with the
# source application; copying and then closing the app loses the content.
wl-clipboard
cliphist

# Screenshots
grim
slurp

# Lock, idle, wallpaper
hyprlock
hypridle
hyprpaper

# Polkit. hyprpolkitagent needs Qt6, which quickshell already requires, so its
# marginal cost is lower than lxqt-policykit, which pulls in lxqt-session.
hyprpolkitagent

# Session. ADR-0008: greetd with tuigreet, chosen so the login path has no GPU
# or Wayland dependency.
greetd
tuigreet

# Audio
pipewire
pipewire-audio
pipewire-pulse
wireplumber

# Network. No graphical applet: quickshell shows state, nmtui configures.
network-manager

# Fonts. Neither foot nor fuzzel depends on a font, and without one the desktop
# starts with no usable text.
fonts-dejavu-core
